00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:43,730
For the training scenario, work in this
order.

57
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,799
Step 1.

58
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:48,240
Review personnel and unit location-age
settings.

59
00:02:48,619 --> 00:02:49,400
Step 2.

60
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:52,540
Add stations and hospitals as points of
interest.

61
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,660
Step 3.

62
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:58,660
Add a relevant map layer, planned route,
or weather zone and review its audience.

63
00:02:59,309 --> 00:03:00,819
Now verify the result.

64
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:05,829
Check marker age and source, POI
placement, reference-layer alignment,

65
00:03:06,009 --> 00:03:08,249
