66
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:13,299
A common problem to watch for: Location
sharing requires client permission.

67
00:03:13,839 --> 00:03:17,819
Uploaded floor plans are reference
material; verify currency and

68
00:03:17,819 --> 00:03:19,739
alignment before relying on them.

69
00:03:20,399 --> 00:03:22,019
Your practice task is simple.

70
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:26,709
Follow a sample unit and compare a recent
position with a stale position.

71
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:30,509
